/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Irfan Nazar\054 BJK22AR007\056 ART 501 Urban Design\054 Module V\056 This presentation develops the Oscar Niemeyer section of UD\055M5\055P2\072 spatial philosophy\054 methodological toolkit\054 Three Powers Square and Congress\054 and the four\055building Pampulha ensemble\056 Planalto\054 the Supreme Court\054 Cathedral and Itamaraty give the Bras\355lia buildings their context\056 Discuss how architectural form shapes public space\054 then critically appraise everyday use\056 Allow about 25 minutes\054 or use the menu to select cases for a shorter talk\056)
