/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Niemeyer\220s dates are 1907\2052012\056 His modernism developed through collaboration\054 including Costa and Le Corbusier\056 President Juscelino Kubitschek appointed him chief architect of Bras\355lia in 1956\056 The 1988 Pritzker Prize honoured both Niemeyer and Gordon Bunshaft\056 Pampulha was an early major independent commission\054 but its landscape\054 engineering and art were collaborative\056 Avoid describing the ensemble as a solo accomplishment\056)
