/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The document describes monumental modernism\054 civic axes and sculptural politics\056 Explain these terms using specific spatial evidence\056 Niemeyer extended the structural and spatial experiments of modernism through expressive concrete\056 He did not simply abandon function or engineering\056 Civic\055stage language is an interpretation of the capital\220s composition\056 Assess it alongside programme\054 movement and public use\056)
