/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The DOCX identifies the Plano Piloto hierarchy\054 negative space and the plasticity of concrete\056 Attribute the master plan to Costa and the principal civic buildings to Niemeyer\056 Negative space means the unbuilt ground between built forms\056 Concrete can make shells\054 frames and columns\056 The structures in this presentation should not all be described as thin shells or hyperbolic paraboloids\056 Engineers and construction teams realise the forms\056)
