/Contents (Bras\355lia developed as a capital project from 1956 to 1960\056 L\372cio Costa designed the Plano Piloto\056 Oscar Niemeyer designed its principal civic buildings\056 Kubitschek\220s government commissioned the capital\054 with contributions from engineers\054 artists\054 landscape designers and construction workers\056 City\055wide transport outcomes and social conditions also reflect policy and infrastructure\056 Building authorship alone cannot explain them\056)
