/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Costa\220s plan has a monumental east\055west axis and a curved transport axis supporting north and south residential wings\056 Superquadras form neighbourhood units\056 Ministries occupy the Esplanade leading toward Congress and Three Powers Square\056 Diplomatic buildings such as Itamaraty belong to this civic sequence\054 but the embassy sectors should not all be placed on the monumental spine\056 The DOCX sketch is a relational hierarchy\054 so the presentation uses a labelled schematic rather than a measured plan\056)
/QuadPoints [ 821.8898 575.2756 822.8898 575.2756 821.8898 576.2756 822.8898 576.2756 ]
