/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Pra\347a dos Tr\352s Poderes translates as Three Powers Square\056 It lies at the eastern end of the Monumental Axis\056 Congress\054 Planalto and the Supreme Federal Court represent the legislature\054 executive and judiciary\056 The diagram shows the relationship rather than an exact equilateral geometry\056 The document\220s flag claim needs correction\072 the flag is replaced\054 not the same cloth continuously flying since 1960\056 A Ministry of Defence account describes a monthly ceremony and a flag up to 40 kg\054 rather than the document\220s 90 kg\056 The mast is a later addition\054 not evidence of Niemeyer\220s 1960 design\056 These peripheral details should not dominate the appraisal\056)
/QuadPoints [ 821.8898 575.2756 822.8898 575.2756 821.8898 576.2756 822.8898 576.2756 ]
/Rect [ 821.8898 575.2756 822.8898 576.2756 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
