/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The document critiques monumental distance\054 lack of shade and a car\055oriented setting\056 Present these as an assessment of spatial conditions\054 not an invented survey of all users\056 Photographs and diagrams show broad open ground and surrounding roads\056 IPHAN\220s restoration information identifies public concerns around accessibility\054 safety and signage\056 Fieldwork should test crossings\054 shade\054 seating\054 transit arrival and institutional entry\056 The strong civic image and the practical quality of a visit need separate evidence\056)
