/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Planalto is a workplace\054 not the president\220s official residence\056 Casa Civil records its inauguration on 21 April 1960\056 Niemeyer\220s external columns separate the structural silhouette from the glazing\056 Read the building as part of the square\054 while recognising that a government workplace has controlled entry\056 The photograph illustrates the supports and reflections\054 not a current public\055access audit\056)
