/Contents (The Supreme Federal Court moved to Bras\355lia on 21 April 1960\056 Its official history credits the complex to Oscar Niemeyer and the sculpture A Justi\347a to Alfredo Ceschiatti\056 The sculptural supports and glazed volume create an institutional frontage rather than a continuous commercial street edge\056 Do not infer public entry arrangements from visual transparency\056)
