/Contents (The Pritzker selected works date the Cathedral to 1970\056 The 16 supports are documented by UNESCO\056 The DOCX introduces it with the 1956\2051960 capital project\054 but the completed building should not be dated 1960\056 Avoid treating its crown\055like image as a literal construction system\056 Analyse the sequence and light alongside the landmark form\056)
