150 0 obj
<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The DOCX identifies Pampulha as an early major urban commission\056 UNESCO dates its conception to 1940 and Belo Horizonte records the ensemble inauguration in 1943\056 Distinguish commission\054 construction and later heritage recognition\056 Kubitschek was mayor of Belo Horizonte when he commissioned the ensemble\054 before becoming president\056 Four core buildings form the UNESCO ensemble\072 casino\054 ballroom\054 yacht club and church\056 It was collaborative\054 with landscape by Roberto Burle Marx and integrated art\056 Public heritage status does not mean unrestricted entry to every building\056)
/QuadPoints [ 821.8898 575.2756 822.8898 575.2756 821.8898 576.2756 822.8898 576.2756 ]
/Rect [ 821.8898 575.2756 822.8898 576.2756 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
