/Contents (The municipality describes a glazed rectangular form and connecting ramps\054 correcting the impression that the casino is only a curved building\056 Its museum history records a casino operating from 1943 to 1946 and creation of the art museum in 1957\056 The programme shift shows adaptation of a public landmark\056 The image is documentary photography and does not establish current opening or conservation conditions\056)
