/Contents (Belo Horizonte\220s history describes two internally tangent circles\054 a sinuous canopy and a small concrete bridge\056 The original programme was a restaurant with a dance floor\056 The municipality dates opening to 1942\054 while the ensemble inauguration was in 1943\056 Use the early\0551940s period consistently\056 Credit Burle Marx for landscape and Albino Froufe for this building\220s structural design\056 Do not automatically attribute every Pampulha structure to Joaquim Cardozo\056)
