/Contents (The official Belo Horizonte portal identifies a butterfly roof\054 glazed surfaces\054 ramps and brises\055soleil\054 and describes the nautical intent of the terrace\056 The original Golf Yacht Club later became the Yacht Tennis Club\056 Its privatisation in 1961 is relevant to social access\056 Do not use the Niemeyer Foundation\220s 1962 Yacht Club entry to date the original early\0551940s building\072 it concerns a later project\056 Current admission conditions should be checked separately before a visit\056)
