/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The DOCX links organic promenades\054 regional ceramic traditions and modern form\056 Pampulha\220s UNESCO inscription in 2016 recognises this synthesis\056 Joaquim Cardozo contributed engineering within the ensemble\054 but Casa do Baile\220s documented structural engineer is Albino Froufe\056 The commissioned leisure landscape also had social and patronage contexts\056 Critical appraisal should test route continuity\054 present access\054 maintenance and the relationship between heritage and daily use\056)
/QuadPoints [ 821.8898 575.2756 822.8898 575.2756 821.8898 576.2756 822.8898 576.2756 ]
