/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (This is an interpretive comparison rather than a performance score\056 Bras\355lia offers strong institutional legibility and a monumental composition\056 Pampulha relates cultural and leisure buildings to a landscape\056 Both need assessment at walking speed\056 Neither visual openness nor World Heritage designation proves universal access\056 Compare the scale\054 connections and actual programmes before borrowing a formal solution for studio\056)
