/Contents (Connect the case study to ART 501 CO4 and CO5\056 For an S9 urban public project\054 document the setting\054 trace arrival\054 record users and activities\054 and explain how form shapes open space\056 Imageability\054 figure\055ground\054 activity mapping and pedestrian catchment analysis can support the appraisal\056 Record observation dates and methods\056 The checklist helps structure a study without inventing field counts or treating a photograph as a measured access audit\056)
